extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tLVvbI4jdQAQ7kNvwEW5VhQ&_nc_oc=AdpZiuTtL_AzzdDz29qLfOZUbP_LrBQYnKaV906yx7wROIRB11--s47gQwSz1ebOeLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNuqOQ77V4IyWR1VHbKOyJ7RNhmpqX5ntKy2Gd7ejd63A&oe=6ADE1E56"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OHki9LE_mIQQ7kNvwFxosPI&_nc_oc=AdplbJ-6yK9-jlqyFPMnxGAqiBhceIOALW-xYRxNng5nxbMTgicjNp57gMwx5dTDzts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNfhT6q-jyWZLAFoBDlngsuvA6HSFba723IU5b_iO46KQ&oe=6ADE25A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P3ZM-nmNhDYQ7kNvwE_kSxo&_nc_oc=AdqxM7gJFmYyb1b7H9x8OYo5No5RPurn-S3F-KD6GuW60dYk9Nc3E1j0-D19kafk5lM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOsuAl8_Pmeu7LpCtJ-iHXv5Be9jzBG4icl3aoDYFQAkA&oe=6ADDF559"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":